From 0296cb470b2906e243fdcf2a5a53729047847cca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: noname713705 <noname713705@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 10:24:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Build REL_1.0 with gradle-0.9 from build files in the 0.9 DSL

The 1.0 build files are unchanged. Added, for the gradle-0.9 builder:
- settings.gradle.0.9: the projects of 1.0 without docs, integTest, internalTesting,
  internalIntegTesting, performance, website; build files <name>.gradle.0.9
- buildSrc/settings.gradle: gradle-0.9 builds buildSrc before any settings script; selects
  buildSrc/build.gradle.0.9 when the running Gradle is 0.9, any other Gradle keeps build.gradle
- build.gradle.0.9, buildSrc/build.gradle.0.9, subprojects/*/<name>.gradle.0.9 and the used script
  plugins (compile, conventions-dsl, groovyProject, providedConfiguration): no ext (plain project
  properties), mavenRepo instead of maven { url }, no resolutionStrategy, withType(...).each,
  sourceSets.main.classesDir instead of output (classpath manifests and generated resources written
  into the classes dirs), start scripts with a plain URLClassLoader; ide, code quality, publishing,
  docs, tests, zips, install, release and wrapper update tasks left out; explodedDist (Sync of
  binDistImage) into build/distributions/exploded
- jcifs:jcifs:1.3.17@jar instead of org.samba.jcifs:jcifs:1.3.17 (not on Maven Central)
Source: MAVEN_CENTRAL_URL https, without trailing slash.
The jars of lib/ and lib/plugins/ are the same as in the Gradle 1.0 binary distribution.

Run: gradle-0.9 -c settings.gradle.0.9 clean explodedDist

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
